## .NET build output
bin/
obj/

## Published artifacts
artifacts/

## Unified launch folder - refreshed by build.ps1, always derived, never committed
launch/

## Python bytecode - written into the probe folder whenever anything imports it, so it is routinely
## a compile of the *previous* bytes; derived, and never the file the pin or Live reads.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Local scratch
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

## Not part of the product: Ableton's own stock template is read from the Live install at
## runtime, never copied into the repository.

